# whisper-local configuration
#
# Copy to ~/.config/whisper-local/config and edit. This file is sourced by the
# shell, so use `name=value`. Every setting is optional: the defaults below are
# what the tool uses when the file is absent. Environment variables override it.

# ── Input device ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave unset (the default) to record from whatever macOS has set as the system
# default input. This is the recommended setting: dictation then follows the
# device you pick in System Settings > Sound, like any other app.
# Set it only to pin one specific device regardless of the system default. Use
# the exact name shown by `whisper-local doctor`.
# WHISPER_LOCAL_DEVICE="USB Audio CODEC"

# ── Model and language ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# By default the newest, highest-quality ggml model found in the usual
# whisper.cpp locations is used. Set this to pin a specific one.
# WHISPER_LOCAL_MODEL="$HOME/.local/share/whisper-local/models/ggml-large-v3-turbo.bin"

# Spoken language, as an ISO 639-1 code. Use "auto" to detect it per recording,
# at some cost in accuracy and speed.
# WHISPER_LOCAL_LANG="en"

# Decoding threads. Defaults to whisper.cpp's own choice.
# WHISPER_LOCAL_THREADS="8"

# ── Silence detection ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A capture below BOTH of these is treated as silence and never sent to the
# model, because whisper invents plausible filler when given silent audio.
# Lower them if a genuinely quiet microphone is being rejected; raise them if
# room noise is getting transcribed. `whisper-local doctor` prints the levels
# your microphone actually produces.
# WHISPER_LOCAL_PEAK_MIN="0.0008"
# WHISPER_LOCAL_RMS_MIN="0.0006"

# ── Limits ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Captures shorter than this are treated as a fumbled keypress, in seconds.
# WHISPER_LOCAL_MIN_SEC="0.30"

# Recording stops on its own after this many seconds, so a forgotten recording
# cannot fill the disk.
# WHISPER_LOCAL_MAX_SEC="1800"

# ── Paths ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Override only if the tool cannot find these on its own.
# WHISPER_LOCAL_SOX="/opt/homebrew/bin/sox"
# WHISPER_LOCAL_WHISPER="$HOME/code/whisper.cpp/build/bin/whisper-cli"
# WHISPER_LOCAL_LOG="$HOME/Library/Logs/whisper-local.log"
